  "details": "Whenever I publish, test or upload this avatar, the expressions menu circle thing just shows the action name as \"Button Text\" (my action type drop down is set to button but that's none of the matter lol), anyway, nothing happens when I try and select that \"Button Text\" in VRChat's main game, other than the 'select/click' sound being heard when i try to push the action.\n\n- I've tried deleting and reinstalling both creator companion and unity.\n\n- Made sure both creator companion and unity are up to date to their latest versions\n\n- Tried making a fresh new test avatar project, and the same problem persists there as well.\n\nPlease help, this is driving me nuts!",
